1. Permitted use
----------------

End users may install and run an official, unmodified NoMosaic release for
private, non-commercial use. Beyond that end-user permission, the NoMosaic
Project Administrator grants access to, copying of, study of, and modification
of original NoMosaic project material solely for non-commercial secondary
development. "Secondary development" means creating, testing, or maintaining
a modified or derivative version of NoMosaic.

Distribution is permitted only when it is part of a genuine non-commercial
modified or derivative project. Any distributed derivative must:

- clearly identify that it is modified from NoMosaic;
- retain this complete LICENSE file and all copyright notices;
- use the same non-commercial restrictions for the NoMosaic-derived portions;
- preserve all third-party license notices; and
- avoid suggesting endorsement by the NoMosaic Project Administrator.

No permission is granted to redistribute the unmodified project or release
package as a standalone mirror.

2. Commercial use is prohibited
--------------------------------

Commercial use is prohibited without prior written permission from the
NoMosaic Project Administrator. Prohibited commercial use includes selling,
licensing for a fee, paid distribution, paid support or modification services,
use in a revenue-generating product or service, advertising-supported
distribution, and bundling with a commercial product.

3. Ownership and termination
-----------------------------

The NoMosaic Project Administrator retains ownership of the original patcher
source, project-specific build configuration, installer scripts, release
packaging, documentation, research reports, diagrams, verification logic, and
workflow metadata.

This permission terminates automatically upon violation of these terms. After
termination, all distribution and commercial use must stop. Rights not
expressly granted are reserved.

4. Game and engine rights
-------------------------

FallenFlower, its executable files, assets, characters, artwork, audio,
trademarks, and other game content belong to their respective rights holders.
Unity and related marks belong to their respective rights holders. The NoMosaic
Project Administrator claims no ownership of that content.

This repository and its release package do not intentionally redistribute an
original or patched FallenFlower resource bundle. The installer operates on a
compatible game installation already present on the user's computer.

The project is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Users and
developers are responsible for complying with applicable law, game terms, and
third-party licenses.

